---
import ExternalLink from "./ExternalLink.astro";
---

<footer
  class="relative flex flex-wrap w-full items-center justify-between bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-neutral-900 dark:text-gray-200 caddy-shadow px-caddy py-6 grow-0 shrink-0">
  <div class="caddy-wrapper">
    <div class="flex max-w-caddy flex-wrap items-center basis-full justify-between">
      <div class="text-sm max-w-[80%]">
        <p>
          本站由 <ExternalLink href="https://nic.seu.edu.cn">
            东南大学网络与信息中心
          </ExternalLink> 支持创办，由东南大学 SiliCOM 协会与 <ExternalLink href="https://seulinux.com/">东南大学 Linux 俱乐部</ExternalLink> 运行维护。
        </p>
        <p>使用 <ExternalLink href="https://astro.build/">{Astro.generator}</ExternalLink> 构建，运行于 <ExternalLink href="https://deno.com/">Deno</ExternalLink> 之上。</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <a href="https://seulinux.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/linux-club-logo.svg" class="min-w-[20%] h-12 dark:filter dark:brightness-90"></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
